<title>UK: Pilkington fills new building products post.</title>
<headline>Pilkington fills new building products post.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British glassmaker Pilkington Plc on Wednesday said it appointed Warren D. Knowlton to the new post of President, Building Products World-wide.</p>
<p>Knowlton joins from U.S. building material company Owens-Corning.</p>
<p>More than half Pilkington Group's sales are in glass products for buildings, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
